      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Downtown_Edmonton"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Neon Sign Museum, opened in 2014 south of 104 Avenue, showcases vintage signs from Edmonton’s long‑gone businesses.",
